// ============================================================================
//  mod_ballisticknife.zone  -  the ballistic knife, so Who's Who can hand one
//  over on ORIGINS.
//
//  README "known issues" said: *"Who's Who gives you no ballistic knife on
//  Origins or Mob of the Dead ... Bringing it over from another map is
//  possible, but has not been attempted."*  This is that attempt.
//
//  MEASURED FIRST, 2026-08-31:
//    * `Unlinker --list` over retail zm_prison.ff and zm_tomb.ff finds ZERO
//      knife_ballistic weapons; zm_transit.ff and zm_highrise.ff each carry all
//      six variants. So the gun genuinely is not on those maps - the old note
//      was right about the cause.
//    * zm_transit's and zm_highrise's copies of knife_ballistic_zm,
//      _upgraded_zm and _no_melee_zm are BYTE-IDENTICAL (md5). So it does not
//      matter which of the two --load slots wins here, and mod.ff owning the
//      def cannot change what TranZit or Die Rise already ship. That is the
//      §38 content-swap trap checked and cleared before writing this file.
//    * The perk's own guard is already dynamic, not a hard-coded map list -
//      quality_of_life.gsc's zmqol_whoswho_knife_watch() keys off whether the
//      weapon is included on the map. So no give-logic changes; the weapon
//      simply has to exist and be included.
//
//  🛑 MOB OF THE DEAD IS NOT PART OF THIS AND NEVER WAS. Mob does not have
//  Who's Who at all, so there is nothing there to give a knife to. The README
//  naming both maps was wrong and is corrected in the same commit.
//
//  fx: OAT can neither dump nor link fx from raw, so the two the def names have
//  to come from a --load'ed fastfile that OWNS them. zm_transit.ff does, and
//  build_ff.bat already loads it - that is why they are declared here rather
//  than shipped as raw .efx like the wonder weapons' 27.
// ============================================================================

weapon,knife_ballistic_zm
weapon,knife_ballistic_upgraded_zm

xmodel,t5_weapon_ballistic_knife_viewmodel
xmodel,t5_weapon_ballistic_knife_world
xmodel,t5_weapon_ballistic_knife_blade

fx,weapon/knife_ballistic/fx_trail_knife_ballistic
